  "title": "Apple Crumble Coffee Cake",
  "description": "Chef John&#39;s tempting apple crumb cake recipe has diced apples layered with a buttery cinnamon-walnut crumble for an elevated, irresistible coffee cake.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-05-06T17:32:39-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2025-06-16T11:17:15-04:00",
  "prep_time": "PT25M",
  "cook_time": "PT40M",
  "total_time": "PT95M",
  "yield": [
    "8",
    "1 (9x12-inch) cake"
  ],
  "categories": [
    "Dessert"
  ],
  "cuisines": [
    "American"
  ],
  "regions": [
    "American"
  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "2 teaspoons unsalted butter",
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 teaspoon baking powder",
    "0.75 teaspoon baking soda",
    "0.5 teaspoon fine sea salt",
    "1.5 cups finely chopped toasted walnuts",
    "0.33333334326744 cup packed light brown sugar",
    "0.33333334326744 cup white sugar",
    "3 tablespoons unsalted butter, melted",
    "1 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "0.25 teaspoon salt",
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "0.5 cup unsalted butter, at room temperature",
    "2 large eggs",
    "1 cup plain yogurt",
    "1.5 teaspoons vanilla extract",
    "2 Honeycrisp apples"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CnCM8ZkQ-hfq6O426lIKg8h1OQE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-280118-apple-crumble-coffee-cake-DDMFS-step-01-0520b3e09fd84108ab7725e683c5e4be.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/280118/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C) with an rack in the center position. Generously butter a 9x12-inch baking dish with 2 teaspoons butter.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WpDzO85vloW-Q2_VDCdu23dZXKA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-280118-apple-crumble-coffee-cake-DDMFS-step-02-7e27ff6f20c04f68ab5375c7920d4afd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/280118/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk flour, baking powder, baking soda, and ½ teaspoon sea salt together in a bowl; set dry ingredients aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ytICemApVWPScMef0_ztqTQpefI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-280118-apple-crumble-coffee-cake-DDMFS-step-03-ca13333f0817473abba02ff30e614349.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/280118/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine walnuts, ⅓ cup brown sugar, ⅓ cup white sugar, 3 tablespoons melted butter, cinnamon, and ¼ teaspoon salt in a bowl until walnuts and sugars are thoroughly coated with butter; set crumble mixture aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/awhPUdU_Zn09jNp-9rW1LyvC1h0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-280118-apple-crumble-coffee-cake-DDMFS-step-04-326bf362d43249dd9f3174855fe29ce2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/280118/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat 1 cup white sugar and ½ cup butter together in a separate bowl with a spatula until well blended.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/opioWwGIBvkzxmdNuqDXgVe4m7U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-280118-apple-crumble-coffee-cake-DDMFS-step-05-b202e1cd117a407a833607d4cb622ed5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/280118/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk in 1 egg until mixture is smooth, 2 to 3 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/P_1qdAHnc7QjNdqCBw6JGBkQxnc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-280118-apple-crumble-coffee-cake-DDMFS-step-06-9b17c9e816c2461d880e003bf8a601e7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/280118/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk in second egg until thoroughly incorporated. Add yogurt and vanilla; whisk together.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JcT8jplQhoHUO3CXZiLhODxB2i4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-280118-apple-crumble-coffee-cake-DDMFS-step-07-95d38eb1900d41a69118f4846dac76e1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/280118/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add flour mixture to yogurt mixture; whisk just until flour disappears. Do not overmix.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2Yaow1cAkXyROPifSwptDBJn4Fs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-280118-apple-crumble-coffee-cake-DDMFS-step-08-d5379f279fa44cc8bbe59d6dac7a962c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/280118/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove and discard cores from apples. Cut apples into ⅛- to ¼-inch slices. Stack a few slices; cut down the center, lengthwise, then dice, crosswise, into cubes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Me05t8RQWzz2j6XKZlQ8YLyWcY4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-280118-apple-crumble-coffee-cake-DDMFS-step-010-95b8e65e33f148448383fa4d958ca0e6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/280118/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fold apples into cake batter with a spatula until just combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/kthjg3_O8QyDKNXtxr94EPDE9xo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-280118-apple-crumble-coffee-cake-DDMFS-step-011-dbd7aca5b42c495a863a9fe23ec9f9ba.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/280118/step_10.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread ½ the batter into the prepared baking dish; evenly scatter ½ crumble mixture over top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UsSjoXFOZHXJJNT3vSdTmRdhqr8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-280118-apple-crumble-coffee-cake-DDMFS-step-013-861d77e47672480f92f9abc04346c417.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/280118/step_11.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dollop remaining ½ batter on top crumble mixture; spread carefully to evenly distribute, trying not to disturb the crumbs.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-wQWtjE5n92wYK-NPNDT72qD_NE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-280118-apple-crumble-coffee-cake-DDMFS-step-014-5c05aa39e5794902a98c790c912f0b53.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/280118/step_12.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Top with remaining ½ crumble mixture; press crumbs into the batter very gently.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NAH4BcKwDe2p2tK6M5NFZLpwyUc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-280118-apple-crumble-coffee-cake-DDMFS-step-015-e975cfaedf014ef8bfc462df984cce36.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/280118/step_13.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the center of the preheated oven until a toothpick or bamboo skewer inserted into the center comes out clean, about 40 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7Mo7Wq-6HeOm1-KarGIoLmLezrE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-280118-apple-crumble-coffee-cake-DDMFS-step-016-5581fdadb7d74a21ac6abc44bed91857.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/280118/step_14.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cool to room temperature before slicing and serving, about 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RyqKLSi81-FJJZAjWmWNDNSeHaM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-280118-apple-crumble-coffee-cake-DDMFS-beauty-4x3-7d9cea59f99040cf91edcdf92500f5f2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/280118/step_15.webp"
    }
  ],
